================================================================================
TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

If rebuild fails:
  1. Check CMakeLists.txt exists in project root
  2. Try: rm -rf build && mkdir build && cd build && cmake ..
  3. Check compiler version: g++ --version (need C++14 or higher)

If injection still doesn't work:
  1. Add more debug prints to verify code path is reached
  2. Check render_gain_ value (should be 1.0 by default)
  3. Verify has_render_grads_ is being set to true
  4. Check stored_render_grad_F_ has non-zero values


